  "description": "Nina, a ghost who clings to her first love, Jae-seong, and knocks out all the women who approach him.  Her messenger from the underworld, Chadol, came to help her become a Buddha.  He is called the best god of death, but because of Nina's strong obsession, she repeatedly fails to attain Buddhahood, and in the process, the two gradually grow closer...  On top of that, Nina's hidden past is gradually revealed?!  Will he be able to safely make Nina a Buddha!!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55870570), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B0%80%EC%9E%A5-%EB%8B%AC%EC%BD%A4%ED%95%9C-%EC%97%91%EC%86%8C%EC%8B%9C%EC%A6%98/3646)",
